Output demo/output/prompt-demo.mp4
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1280
Set Height 500
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Padding 20

Type "cat songs/traditional/when-the-saints-go-marching-in.prompt"
Enter 1
Sleep 4s

Type "claude -p < songs/traditional/when-the-saints-go-marching-in.prompt"
Enter 1
Sleep 120s
